@startuml
!include _style.iuml
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam nodesep 70
skinparam ranksep 70
title State machine: Registration
[*] --> New : parent submits form\n/ number, PDF, e-mail
New --> Contacted : admin marks contacted
New --> Confirmed : admin confirms\n/ link to athlete
Contacted --> Confirmed : admin confirms\n/ link to athlete
New --> Rejected : admin rejects
Contacted --> Rejected : admin rejects
New --> New : admin edits data\n/ rebuild PDF
Confirmed --> Archived : season moved to archive
Rejected --> Archived : season moved to archive
Archived --> [*]
@enduml
